# Workout Dashboard

A personal workout and weight tracking dashboard built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Features

- Workout logging
- Daily workout notes
- Weight progress tracking
- Progress circle
- Workout streak tracking
- GitHub-style consistency heatmap
- Local browser storage (no account required)

## Technologies

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- LocalStorage

